rogram","pieces":2623}],"facts":[{"text":"The biggest set in the catalog is Sagrada Família with 12,060 pieces.","q":"21065-1"},{"text":"The oldest sets in here are from 1949, like Large Gift Set (ABB). That is 77 years of bricks.","q":"700.2-1"},{"text":"2025 was the busiest year so far, with 747 sets."},{"text":"10 years ago, in 2016, LEGO put out 555 sets. The biggest was Firehouse Headquarters with 4,642 pieces.","q":"75827-1"},{"text":"20 years ago, in 2006, LEGO put out 255 sets. The biggest was XXL 2000 with 2,000 pieces.","q":"5491-1"},{"text":"25 years ago, in 2001, LEGO put out 257 sets. The biggest was Darth Maul with 1,868 pieces.","q":"10018-1"},{"text":"30 years ago, in 1996, LEGO put out 150 sets. The biggest was Bonus Lego Basic Town with 2,542 pieces.","q":"9287-1"},{"text":"40 years ago, in 1986, LEGO put out 119 sets. The biggest was Highway Rig with 668 pieces.","q":"5580-1"},{"text":"50 years ago, in 1976, LEGO put out 74 sets. The biggest was Educational LEGO Building Set with 683 pieces.","q":"1045-2"},{"text":"60 years ago, in 1966, LEGO put out 77 sets. The biggest was Master Builder Set with 817 pieces.","q":"004-1"},{"text":"70 years ago, in 1956, LEGO put out 7 sets. The biggest was ESSO Filling Station with 96 pieces.","q":"1310-1"},{"text":"An average set in 1996 had 213 pieces. Last year it was 493."},{"text":"Duplo has more sets than any other theme: 1,071 and counting."},{"text":"Every set in the catalog adds up to 46,24,152 pieces. Building one of each would take a while."}],"news":[{"title":"Random set of the day: Surveillance Scooter","link":"https://brickset.com/article/136474","date":"2026-11-22T03:01:02.000Z"},{"title":"What's hot this week","link":"https://brickset.com/article/136471","date":"2026-11-21T23:01:02.000Z"},{"title":"Brickset Bouts: Best Modular Building Semi-Final 2","link":"https://brickset.com/article/136462","date":"2026-11-21T17:00:00.000Z"},{"title":"Holiday gift guide: under $25","link":"https://brickset.com